{
    "title": "Bottle Jump 3D",
    "description": "Everyone\u2019s favorite bottle flip challenge is now available on your phone! Make your water bottle flip through all the obstacles in a room and become a flip master! Play Bottle Jump 3D, challenge your friends and have lots of fun!\r\n\r\nIn Bottle Jump 3D, your goal is to finish all levels safe and sound by doing a home flip. Toss your bottle just right so it lands standing up. Be careful! Don\u2019t touch the floor unless you want to crush your bottle.\r\n\r\nThe jumping game controls are super simple. Tap the screen and watch the bottle flip. Tap twice on the screen to jump higher and spin the bottle in the air! Easy to learn, hard to master.\r\n\r\nMake it to the end through obstacles and advance to the next room. The more levels you beat, the cooler your rewards! Will you complete all the bottle flip challenges on the first try?\r\n\r\nCollect as many gold caps as you can to unlock new amazing bottle skins! Milk, coke, poison, and tons of other bottles are waiting for you. Make tiktok videos with stylish flipping bottles! \r\n\r\nPlay one of the best tik tok games online or offline! The fun bottle flipping game requires no WiFi connection so you can play wherever you like.\r\n\r\nAre you tired after a hard day? Bottle Jump 3D is a great way to relieve stress and relax while flipping bottles.\r\n\r\n<b>Why you\u2019ll love Bottle Jump 3D:</b>\r\n\r\n- Play 200+ fun & challenging levels. Can you complete them all?\r\n- Enjoy simple & exciting gameplay! You won\u2019t want to stop flipping bottles!\r\n- Get stress relief. Have a rest playing one of the best relaxing games\r\n- Interact with level decorations! Use the items around to complete the missions\r\n- Unlock dozens of cool skins! Collect all the bottles!\r\n\r\nThe bottle challenge has never been so fun! Play Bottle Jump 3D, make your bottle flip over obstacles, and become the flip master!\r\n\r\n=====================\r\n<strong>COMPANY COMMUNITY:</strong> \r\n=====================\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/AzurGamesOfficial\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/azur_games\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/AzurInteractiveGames",
